        "TileImage": "$($repository 856b2aa2-e224-48c3-b890-01fdf4dba6de).Image",
        "Description": "We&apos;ve got another job, 47. \r\rA curious young man claiming to be from the future has tasked us with the elimination of two key figures. First is Helen West, described by the time-traveler as the matriarch of the Muffin Magnate, rivaling only Mickey Mouse in terms of future control of the baked goods industry. \r\rSecond is James Batty, alleged father of the time-traveler. He claims he loathes the old man and wishes to see if a paradox is created before his birth in a year..Curious.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
